  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1032835,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Sound: A Commodore 64 Symphony of Skill\n\nDive into the vibrant world of *1st Sound*, a unique and challenging sports game for the Commodore 64! Forget traditional football – this isn't about kicking a ball. Instead, you control a team of musicians, each possessing distinct instrumental skills, competing in a series of rhythmic challenges.\n\nThe gameplay revolves around perfectly timed button presses, mimicking musical sequences to score points and outmaneuver your opponents. Each musician has strengths and weaknesses – a powerful drummer might dominate the beat, while a nimble guitarist excels in quick-fire sequences. Mastering their individual abilities and coordinating your team is key to victory.\n\n*1st Sound* features a catchy soundtrack, vibrant pixel art, and increasingly complex musical patterns as you progress. Face off against a variety of opponents, each with their own unique musical style and challenges.  Unlock new musicians, upgrade their skills, and strive to become the ultimate musical champion! Prepare for a rhythm-based sporting experience unlike anything you've played before."
    },
